{"id":"9d41937b5cf52c18","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-reed-muller-code.md","title":"Reed–Muller 多项式求值码","display":"df-reed-muller-code — Reed–Muller 多项式求值码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-reed-muller-code","aliases":["28-df-reed-muller-code"],"display":"df-reed-muller-code — Reed–Muller 多项式求值码","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Definition 19.12; §19.2.4","source_printed_pages":"383","source_pdf_pages":"409","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-reed-muller-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-reed-muller-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reed-muller-code — Reed–Muller 多项式求值码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 19.12; §19.2.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"383"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"409"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为有限域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d&lt;|\\mathbb F|\">\\(d&lt;|\\mathbb F|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\ell,d}\">\\(I_{\\ell,d}\\)</span> 是下式定义的多重指标集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\\)</span>。码字坐标以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb F^\\ell\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb F^\\ell\\)</span> 编号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_{\\ell,d}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^\\ell:\\sum_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\alpha_j\\le d\\},\\qquad |I_{\\ell,d}|=\\binom{\\ell+d}{d}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_{\\ell,d}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^\\ell:\\sum_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\alpha_j\\le d\\},\\qquad |I_{\\ell,d}|=\\binom{\\ell+d}{d}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_a(X_1,\\ldots,X_\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\alpha\\in I_{\\ell,d}}a_\\alpha\\prod_{j=1}^{\\ell}X_j^{\\alpha_j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_a(X_1,\\ldots,X_\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\alpha\\in I_{\\ell,d}}a_\\alpha\\prod_{j=1}^{\\ell}X_j^{\\alpha_j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathbb F,\\ell,d}:\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\\to\\mathbb F^{\\mathbb F^\\ell},\\qquad \\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathbb F,\\ell,d}(a)(x)\\coloneqq P_a(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathbb F,\\ell,d}:\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\\to\\mathbb F^{\\mathbb F^\\ell},\\qquad \\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathbb F,\\ell,d}(a)(x)\\coloneqq P_a(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书把消息写为系数向量，码字写为全域求值表；此处用有限指标集避免额外任意排序。有限求和唯一确定每一坐标。d=0 时得到常值多项式码，并不排除该边界。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 19.12; §19.2.4；印刷页 383；PDF 页 409。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d<|\\mathbb F|","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\ell,d}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb F^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"I_{\\ell,d}\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathbb N^\\ell:\\sum_{j=1}^{\\ell}\\alpha_j\\le d\\},\\qquad |I_{\\ell,d}|=\\binom{\\ell+d}{d}.","display":true},{"tex":"P_a(X_1,\\ldots,X_\\ell)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\alpha\\in I_{\\ell,d}}a_\\alpha\\prod_{j=1}^{\\ell}X_j^{\\alpha_j}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathbb F,\\ell,d}:\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}\\to\\mathbb F^{\\mathbb F^\\ell},\\qquad \\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathbb F,\\ell,d}(a)(x)\\coloneqq P_a(x).","display":true}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-372","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-reed-muller-code]]、[[28-thm-reed-muller-distance]]、[[28-df-list-decodable-code]]、[[28-df-local-decoder]]、[[28-thm-berlekamp-welch-decoding]]、[[28-lem-hardcore-distribution]]、[[28-df-local-list-decoder]]。"},{"id":"ca1cc46ea16ab569","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb F,\\ell,d,I_{\\ell,d},P_a,\\operatorname{RM}$ 采用 [[28-df-reed-muller-code]] 的签名；$a,b\\in\\mathbb F^{I_{\\ell,d}}$。$\\mathbb F$ 上不同形式多项式以系数区别。"}],"outgoing":[]}